  "ai_usage": "Nostalgic loader for games, retro pages, or 404s. The mouth is two half-discs rotating around the center; the dots are separate elements on a longer linear loop, so keep the chomp period a clean divisor of the dot travel time.",
  "path": "effects/loaders-spinners/pacman-loader.html",
  "source": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Pac-Man Loader</title>\n  <script type=\"application/json\" id=\"effect-meta\">\n  {\n    \"id\": \"pacman-loader\",\n    \"title\": \"Pac-Man Loader\",\n    \"summary\": \"A chomping arc eats a stream of dots that respawn off-screen.\",\n    \"description\": \"Two clipped half-circles hinge open and closed for the mouth while dots translate leftward on a loop and vanish at the bite point.\",\n    \"theme\": \"loaders-spinners\",\n    \"categories\": [\"loader\", \"retro\"],\n    \"tags\": [\"pacman\", \"retro\", \"game\", \"chomp\", \"dots\"],\n    \"tech\": [\"css\"],\n    \"era\": \"2000s\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"beginner\",\n    \"dependencies\": [],\n    \"browser_support\": \"All modern browsers (Chromium, Firefox, Safari).\",\n    \"performance_notes\": \"Lightweight — composited transform/opacity work only.\",\n    \"accessibility_notes\": \"Decorative status indicator — pair it with a visually-hidden aria-live message so screen readers announce the wait. Motion stops under prefers-reduced-motion.\",\n    \"customization\": [\n      { \"name\": \"--c\", \"description\": \"Character color\", \"default\": \"#fbbf24\" },\n      { \"name\": \"--dot\", \"description\": \"Dot color\", \"default\": \"#e7ebf3\" },\n      { \"name\": \"--dur\", \"description\": \"Chomp speed\", \"default\": \"0.5s\" }\n    ],\n    \"variations\": [\"Ghost chasing behind\", \"Power pellet that flashes\", \"Sound-free retro arcade framing\"],\n    \"ai_usage\": \"Nostalgic loader for games, retro pages, or 404s. The mouth is two half-discs rotating around the center; the dots are separate elements on a longer linear loop, so keep the chomp period a clean divisor of the dot travel time.\"\n  }\n  </script>\n  <style>\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }\n    body { display: grid; place-items: center; background: #0b0d12; color: #e7ebf3;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif; overflow: hidden; }\n    :root { --c: #fbbf24; --dot: #e7ebf3; --dur: .5s; }\n    .pac { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; width: 180px; height: 48px; }\n    .pac .man { position: relative; width: 48px; height: 48px; flex: none; }\n    .pac .man i { position: absolute; left: 0; width: 48px; height: 24px; background: var(--c); }\n    .pac .man .up { top: 0; border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0; transform-origin: 50% 100%; animation: chompU var(--dur) linear infinite; }\n    .pac .man .dn { bottom: 0; border-radius: 0 0 24px 24px; transform-origin: 50% 0; animation: chompD var(--dur) linear infinite; }\n    .pac .dots { position: absolute; left: 56px; display: flex; gap: 22px; }\n    .pac .dots b { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--dot); animation: eat 1.5s linear infinite; animation-delay: var(--d); }\n    @keyframes chompU { 0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0); } 50% { transform: rotate(-34deg); } }\n    @keyframes chompD { 0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0); } 50% { transform: rotate(34deg); } }\n    @keyframes eat { 0% { transform: translateX(60px); opacity: 1; } 90% { opacity: 1; } 100% { transform: translateX(-10px); opacity: 0; } }\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      * { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"pac\" role=\"status\" aria-label=\"Loading\">\n    <div class=\"man\"><i class=\"up\"></i><i class=\"dn\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"dots\"><b style=\"--d:0s\"></b><b style=\"--d:.5s\"></b><b style=\"--d:1s\"></b></div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}
